    {
      "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneIII_2.4/p@95038",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "COUNTESS.\nAh, what sharp stings are in her mildest words!\nRynaldo, you did never lack advice so much\nAs letting her pass so; had I spoke with her,\nI could have well diverted her intents,\nWhich thus she hath prevented.",
